@startuml "Discipline Management Sequence"
skinparam defaultFontSize 28
skinparam defaultFontName "Times New Roman"
skinparam sequenceMessageSize 28

actor "Ban quản lý" as Admin
participant "Giao diện" as FE
participant "DisciplinaryController" as DC
participant "DisciplinaryService" as DS
participant "DisciplinaryDAO" as DDAO
participant "EmailService" as Email
database "CSDL" as DB

== Quản lý phiếu vi phạm ==
Admin -> FE: Xem/Tạo/Sửa/Xóa phiếu
FE -> DC: GET|POST|PUT|DELETE /api/disciplinary
DC -> DS: CRUD operations
DS -> DDAO: query/create/update/delete
DDAO -> DB: SELECT/INSERT/UPDATE disciplinary_records
DB --> DDAO: OK
DS -> DDAO: updateConductScore(student_id)
DDAO -> DB: UPDATE students (conduct_score)
DB --> DDAO: OK
alt Đạt ngưỡng cảnh báo
  DS -> Email: sendWarningEmail(student)
  Email --> DS: OK
end
DC --> FE: 200 OK

== Quản lý quy định vi phạm ==
Admin -> FE: Xem/Thêm/Sửa quy định
FE -> DC: GET|POST|PUT /api/disciplinary/rules
DC -> DS: getRules|createRule|updateRule
DS -> DDAO: query/create/update rules
DDAO -> DB: SELECT/INSERT/UPDATE violation_rules
DB --> DDAO: OK
alt Sửa quy định
  DS -> DDAO: logChange(rule_id)
  DDAO -> DB: INSERT rule_change_logs
  DB --> DDAO: OK
end
DC --> FE: 200 OK

@enduml
